class Solution {
    public boolean asteroidsDestroyed(int mass, int[] asteroids) {
        Arrays.sort(asteroids);
        long curr=mass;
        for( int asteroid: asteroids){
            
            if(curr < asteroid){
                return false;
            }
            curr+=asteroid;
        }
        return true;
    }
}
Approach:
Sort the asteroids in ascending order.
Start with the given mass.
If the current mass is smaller than an asteroid, return false.
Otherwise destroy it, add its mass to your mass, and continue; if all asteroids are destroyed, return true.
